📖 Surah At-Takathur 

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 1: "Alhaakumut-takaathur" (اَلْهٰكُمُ التَّكَاثُرُ)

👉 Matlab: “Tumhe takaasur (zyada se zyada paane ki daud) ne gafil kar diya.”

Roman Urdu Tafseer:
Yahan Allah ta’ala insaan ki ek badi kamzori bayan kar rahe hain:
 insaan dunya mein zyada maal, zyada izzat, zyada followers, zyada asbaab ikattha karne mein lag jata hai.
 Har shakhs chahta hai ke mere paas doosre se zyada ho. Yeh "competition" insaan ko asal maqsood se gafil kar deta hai.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 2: "Hatta zurtumul-maqaabir" (حَتّٰى زُرْتُمُ الْمَقَابِرَ)

👉 Matlab: “Yahan tak ke tum qabr tak pohanch gaye.”

Roman Urdu Tafseer:
Yani yeh dunya ki daud insaan maut aane tak karta rehta hai.
Insan ki aankh sirf qabar ki mitti hi band karti hai. 
Jab tak maut na aa jaye, insaan dunya ke piche bhagta rehta hai. 
Lekin qabr mein jaane ke baad samajh aata hai ke asal zindagi to aakhirat thi.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 3-4: "Kalla sawfa ta’lamoon, Thumma kalla sawfa ta’lamoon" (كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَۙ‏ ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَۙ‏)

👉 Matlab: “Nahi! Tumhe jaldi hi maaloom hoga. Phir (dobara kehta hoon) nahi! Tumhe yaqeenan maaloom ho jaye ga.”

Roman Urdu Tafseer:
Allah ta’ala do baar takrar karte hain — taake insaan ki ghaflat door ho.
Matlab yeh ke abhi tumko samajh nahi aayi, lekin maut ke baad aur Qiyamat ke din tumhe yaqeenan maloom ho jaye ga ke dunya sirf ek khel thi. 
Us waqt tumhari aankhen khulengi, lekin bohot dair ho chuki hogi.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 5: "Kalla law ta’lamoona ‘ilmal-yaqeen" (كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُوْنَ عِلْمَ الْيَقِيْنِۙ‏)

👉 Matlab: “Kaash tum yaqini ilm rakhte!”

Roman Urdu Tafseer:
Yahan Allah insaan ko samjhata hai: kaash tumhari soch itni gehri hoti ke tumhe yaqeen hota ke aakhirat ka hisaab haq hai,
to tum dunya ke lalach mein na phaste. "Ilm-ul-yaqeen" matlab woh pakka ilm jo insaan ke amal ko badal deta hai.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 6-7: "Latarawunnal-jahim, Thumma latarawunnaha ‘ayna-l-yaqeen" (لَتَرَوُنَّ الْجَحِيْمَۙ‏ ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ الْيَقِيْنِۙ‏)

👉 Matlab: “Tum zaroor jahannum ko dekho ge. Phir tum use yaqeen ki aankh se dekhoge.”

Roman Urdu Tafseer:
Insaan agar dunya mein yaqeen se nahi maanta, to Qiyamat ke din usse apni aankhon se dekh lega. 
Jahannum ka deedar haq hai. Yeh Allah ki taraf se ek sakht waeed hai (warning).
Matlab jo aaj sirf mazaak samjha jata hai, kal woh khuli hui haqeeqat ban kar saamne hoga.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 8: "Thumma latus’alunna yawma-idhin ‘anin-na’eem" (ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَـِٕذٍ عَنِ النَّعِيْمِ۠‏)

👉 Matlab: “Phir us din tumse zaroor un ni’maton ke bare mein sawal kiya jaye ga.”

Roman Urdu Tafseer:
Qiyamat ke din sirf gunah ka hisaab nahi hoga, balke Allah ni’maton ka bhi sawal karega:

Tumhari sehat kaise guzari?
Tumhara waqt kis cheez mein lagaya?
Tumhara maal kahan kharch hua?
Tumhari zindagi kaise guzri?
Har ni’mat ek zimmedari hai. Agar shukr ke sath use Allah ki ita’at mein lagaya to najat, warna wohi ni’mat azaab ka sabab banegi.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌙 Paigham aur Asbaq Surah At-Takathur se

Dunya ek fitna hai – Maal aur competition insan ko asal maqsood se gafil kar dete hain.
Qabr asal manzil ki taraf pehla qadam hai – Wahan samajh aata hai ke dunya sirf ikhtibar thi.
Ilm-ul-yaqeen aur ‘Ain-ul-yaqeen – Pehle ilm se yaqeen karo, warna Qiyamat ke din apni aankhon se dekhna padega.
Hisaab ni’maton ka bhi hai – Har ni’mat (maal, sehat, waqt, sukoon, dost, ghar, ilm) ek amanat hai.
Aakhirat ki tayyari – Insan ko apni zindagi ka focus akhirat par rakhna chahiye, dunya sirf zariya hai.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

💡 Message:
Surah At-Takathur humein yeh yaad dilati hai ke dunya ki daud aur maal ka izafa asal kaam nahi hai.
Asal kaam hai akhirat ki tayyari, warna ek din qabar aur qiyamat humein sab kuch samjha degi — lekin us waqt samajhna bekaar hoga.

